{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/jumeirah-living-business-bay-select-group","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":493,"crm_id":"63","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Jumeirah Living Business Bay","slug":"jumeirah-living-business-bay-select-group","display_address":"Business Bay","building_type":["apartment","penthouse"],"completion_year":"2025","developer":"Select Group","price":11061000,"display_price":"","lattitude":25.1829656,"longitude":55.2625552,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":4,"display_bedrooms":"0","about":"<p>Jumeirah Living Business Bay - a luxury project from developer Select Group, located in the Business Bay business district. The complex is a 35-storey tower on the shores of the Dubai Canal. The design of the complex is made in a modern style, and its main feature are glass inserts, which reflect the rays of the sun and the waters of the canal.</p><p>The interiors of the complex are decorated with high quality materials and delicate shades prevail. The windows of each residence offer stunning views of the cityscapes and the Dubai Canal.</p><p>Business Bay has a very developed infrastructure, on the territory of the area residents have access to kindergartens, schools, medical centres, cafes, restaurants and shops. On the territory of JLBB residents will find a swimming pool, gym, yoga and meditation studio, children's play areas, sports fields and a cinema. There are cosy lounge areas for relaxation. There are also apartment cleaning services, concierge and round-the-clock security.</p><p>The complex has a convenient location in close proximity to the main transport arteries of Dubai - Al Khail Road and Sheikh Zayed Road. Burj Khalifa and Dubai Mall are just 5 minutes away, Jumeirah Beach is 10 minutes away. Palm Jumeirah and Dubai Marina are approximately 25 minutes' drive away, while Dubai International Airport is 15 minutes' drive away.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/jum_living_feature_f52a823bee.jpg","hash":"jum_living_feature_f52a823bee","name":"Jumeirah Living Business Bay"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/jum_living_bannar_cea0cd3cc4.jpg","hash":"jum_living_bannar_cea0cd3cc4","name":"Jumeirah Living Business Bay"},"media_images":null,"images":[{"id":11057,"ext":".jpg","url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/63/images/i/jum_living_feature_f52a823bee.jpg","hash":"jum_living_feature_f52a823bee","mime":"image/jpeg","name":"Jumeirah Living Business Bay","size":26.11,"width":530,"height":330,"srcUrl":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/jum_living_feature_f52a823bee.jpg","caption":null,"formats":{"small":{"ext":".jpg","url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i.prod/small_jum_living_feature_f52a823bee.jpg","hash":"small_jum_living_feature_f52a823bee","mime":"image/jpeg","name":"small_jum-living-feature.jpg","path":null,"size":23.36,"width":500,"height":311},"thumbnail":{"ext":".jpg","url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i.prod/thumbnail_jum_living_feature_f52a823bee.jpg","hash":"thumbnail_jum_living_feature_f52a823bee","mime":"image/jpeg","name":"thumbnail_jum-living-feature.jpg","path":null,"size":7.4,"width":245,"height":153}},"provider":"aws-s3","createdAt":"2024-05-01T12:59:45.723Z","updatedAt":"2024-05-01T12:59:53.134Z","folderPath":"/","previewUrl":null,"__ggfxIndex":0,"alternativeText":"Jumeirah Living Business Bay","provider_metadata":null},{"id":11057,"ext":".jpg","url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/63/images/i/jum_living_feature_f52a823bee.jpg","hash":"jum_living_feature_f52a823bee","mime":"image/jpeg","name":"Jumeirah Living Business Bay","size":26.11,"width":530,"height":330,"srcUrl":"https://ggfx-pr